  "term": "brain injury",
  "definition": "In this packet, brain injury refers specifically to traumatic brain injury, which is described as a long-term condition that can extend beyond the acute phase and often requires ongoing rehabilitation and coordinated care. Recovery and access to rehabilitation may be influenced by how healthcare systems are organized, funded, and delivered.",
